1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
冷面的汤，居然要加碎冰
This noodle soup comes with crushed ice

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,700
面用荞麦，混着淀粉
Buckwheat noodles, bound with starch

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,000
煮好过冰水，更筋道
Ice-bathed after boiling, extra springy

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,400
汤是牛骨慢熬，再冰镇
Beef-bone broth, slow-cooked then chilled

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,800
撒把碎冰，飘几片梨
A scoop of ice, a few slices of pear

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,200
辣白菜、黄瓜、半个蛋
Kimchi, cucumber, half an egg

7
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,600
一片牛肉，几颗松子
A slice of beef, a scatter of pine nuts

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,000
端上桌，碗壁全是水珠
It arrives beaded with cold sweat

9
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,400
酸甜冰凉，一口透心
Sweet, sour, ice-cold to the core

10
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,800
延边人的夏天，唱进这碗
Yanbian's summer, sung into a bowl

11
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,600
冷汤加冰，你敢喝吗？评论区见
Iced soup — would you dare? Tell us
